partition "Intelligent Similarity Computation" {

  :Multi-Modal Embedding Generation;
  note left
    **Foundation model embeddings:**
    ```python
    class ModernEmbeddingGenerator:
        def __init__(self):
            self.clip_model = CLIPModel.from_pretrained("openai/clip-vit-large-patch14")
            self.sentence_model = SentenceTransformer('all-mpnet-base-v2')

        def generate_composite_embedding(self, ui_element):
            # Visual embedding (specialized для GUI)
            visual_emb = self.clip_model.encode_image(
                ui_element.cropped_image
            )

            # Text embedding (если есть text)
            text_emb = self.sentence_model.encode(
                ui_element.text_content
            ) if ui_element.text_content else np.zeros(384)

            # Layout embedding (simple but effective)
            layout_emb = self.encode_layout_features(
                ui_element.spatial_context
            )

            # Composite embedding
            return np.concatenate([visual_emb, text_emb, layout_emb])
    ```
  end note

  :Smart Similarity Calculation;
  note right
    **Adaptive similarity computation:**
    ```python
    def calculate_adaptive_similarity(element1, element2):
        # Base similarity через embeddings
        base_sim = cosine_similarity(
            element1.composite_embedding,
            element2.composite_embedding
        )

        # Context-aware adjustments
        adjustments = []

        # Same domain bonus
        if element1.domain == element2.domain:
            adjustments.append(0.1)

        # Temporal proximity bonus
        time_diff = abs(element1.timestamp - element2.timestamp)
        if time_diff < 3600:  # 1 hour
            adjustments.append(0.05)

        # Layout pattern matching
        if element1.visual_group == element2.visual_group:
            adjustments.append(0.08)

        final_similarity = base_sim + sum(adjustments)
        return min(final_similarity, 1.0)
    ```
  end note
